ational融资估值存在15亿、1.5亿与150亿分歧"},"heat":33.5,"trend":"down","trendPct":-13.4,"badges":[],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["Crypto Briefing","The Defiant","The Block","PANews"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/03ab07c950800a2f0f7d53b864faeb17d5b0902b04887c3fe43b9eb83178915c.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/d3547b0702d576d9fb6ec4be5c6417de1dabfad729dbabaa59823134a3d71581.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/03ab07c950800a2f0f7d53b864faeb17d5b0902b04887c3fe43b9eb83178915c.webp 96w","name":"The Block","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp 96w","name":"The Defiant","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Crypto Briefing","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,9.5,18.7,37,36,36,35,34],"summary":"加密交易协议Variational完成1.1亿美元B轮融资，但不同媒体对估值存在显著分歧：PANews和The Defiant援引公司说法称投后估值15亿美元（11月18日），而Crypto Briefing最初称估值1.5亿美元（11月18日），后于11月19日同一媒体突然更正为150亿美元。Variational自2025年1月上线后日均处理量超4750亿美元，传统资产占比过半且已与主要传统市场做市商合作。新资金将用于扩展机构对手方、新增交易市场和提升衍生品头寸上限，并计划2026年底前推出交易API和全天候跨资产衍生品交易。","latest":"Variational完成1.1亿美元B轮融资 估值达150亿美元","cover":null},{"rank":7,"story":{"publicId":"48f0a93f-e6c0-4b3a-aefe-9a0052d54f79","title":"美国CFTC及NFA全牌照认证Backpack完成合规架构"},"heat":32.