ack获美国期货佣金商批准，正式上线衍生品交易","cover":null},{"rank":9,"story":{"publicId":"e8232209-a1a1-4b92-a225-e98c535eb8a4","title":"K3 Capital sBOLD金库遭黑客持续攻击致343万美元被盗"},"heat":31.2,"trend":"up","trendPct":15.1,"badges":["rising"],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["Unchained","Crypto Briefing","PANews","链捕手 ChainCatcher"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/fa45a4b0d924ec2c790ec5c529735ada5876ee1d2094a91834e0ce1ca7df006d.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/1b4d6e1a262b9aeb3b737456d54ad7154cc6e47aea321b5cd3f31dea6c37fa6f.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/fa45a4b0d924ec2c790ec5c529735ada5876ee1d2094a91834e0ce1ca7df006d.webp 96w","name":"Unchained","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Crypto Briefing","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,9.7,18.8,27.5,26.7,26,34.5,33.6,32.6,31.7],"summary":"K3 Capital的sBOLD金库遭黑客攻击，截至2026-11-19 00:30 UTC已窃取约343万美元，攻击仍在持续。攻击者通过闪电贷借入wstETH，利用Liquity V2的「自清算」机制将资金存入稳定池，以低价铸造sBOLD份额并兑换抵押品（ChainCatcher & PANews 11月18日披露）。K3 Capital于11月18日13:08 UTC暂停sBOLD合约，但未披露具体损失或漏洞原因（Unchained 11月19日）。Blockaid监测显示攻击涉及34笔交易，且漏洞利用机制仍在生效（ChainCatcher数据）","latest":"K3 Capital 暂停